        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electric arc furnace slag, low-alloyed, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electric arc furnace slag, low-alloyed, at plant
Economic allocation of EAF slag. Allocation factor: 0.01, assumption 91% reused and 9% landfilled UUID: a6177709-3611-387e-93b4-a9850850ddec
A total amount of 0.17276 kg/kg LS is produced. It is assumed, that 91% of the EAF slag is reused and 9% is deposited. EAF slag has been allocated economically with an allocation factor of 0.01.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: 
Sampling: Data from industry
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_a6177709-3611-387e-93b4-a9850850ddec.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
